        "value": "Oda Nobukane"
      }
    },
    "descriptions": {
      "en": {
        "language": "en",
        "value": "Japanese samurai, the younger brother of the supremely famous warlord, Oda Nobunaga following the Sengoku period of the 16th century"
      },
      "ja": {
        "language": "ja",
        "value": "戦国時代から江戸時代前期の武将・大名。丹波柏原藩初代藩主。長野工藤家17代、信包系織田家初代。織田信秀の四男（異説あり）。従三位、上野介、民部大輔、左中将。子に寿圭"
      }
    },
